th","tags":["健康"],"author":"人民网·健康","source":"人民网·健康","sourceUrl":"http://health.people.com.cn/n1/2025/0601/c14739-40491964.html","cover":"./img/news/a-n_mu4vkez9tai16z-cover.jpg","video":null,"gallery":[],"status":"published","flags":{"headline":false,"hot":false,"blast":false,"focus":false,"top":false,"headlineOrder":0,"recommend":8},"stats":{"views":6,"likes":0,"comments":0,"shares":0,"favs":0,"deltaViews":0,"deltaLikes":0},"publishedAt":"2026-09-17T01:05:40.013Z","scheduledAt":"","origin":"pipeline","inboxId":"mu4tvust4arydq","channelName":"健康","hasVideo":false,"imageCount":1,"hotScore":0.01},{"id":"n_mu4vkexh8xr14r","createdAt":"2026-09-17T01:52:45.461Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-25T10:01:13.318Z","title":"无糖食品不含糖，多吃不会胖……是真是假？","subtitle":"","summary":"按照《食品安全国家标准 预包装食品标签通则》规定，无糖是指每100克或每100毫升食品中，糖(包括蔗糖、果糖、葡萄糖等)的含量不高于0.5克。因此，无糖不等于绝对不含糖。 无糖食品仍含有碳水化合物、脂肪、蛋白质等供能营养","channel":"health","tags":["健康"],"author":"人民网·健康","source":"人民网·健康","sourceUrl":"http://health.people.com.cn/n1/2025/0601/c14739-40491965.html","cover":"./img/news/a-n_mu4vkexh8xr14r-cover.jpg","video":null,"gallery":[],"status":"published","flags":{"headline":false,"hot":false,"blast":false,"focus":false,"top":false,"headlineOrder":0,"recommend":8},"stats":{"views":4,"likes":0,"comments":0,"shares":0,"favs":0,"deltaViews":0,"deltaLikes":0},"publishedAt":"2026-09-17T01:05:40.016Z","scheduledAt":"","origin":"pipeline","inboxId":"mu4tvusw68k9m8","channelName":"健康","hasVideo":false,"imageCount":1,"hotScore":0.01},{"id":"n_mu4vkf14m5dxga","createdAt":"2026-09-17T01:52:45.592Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-25T10:01:13.318Z","title":"专家：只靠意志力戒烟太难，需掌握科学方法","subtitle":"","summary":"5月31日是第38个世界无烟日。日前发布的2024中国成人烟草调查结果显示，中国15岁及以上人群吸烟率为23.2%。 在许多烟民眼中，戒烟是一件需要“钢铁意志力”的事，过程痛苦且漫长。什么原因导致戒烟困难？如何才能科学戒","channel":"health","tags":["健康","专家"],"author":"人民网·健康","source":"人民网·健康","sourceUrl":"http://health.people.com.cn/n1/2025/0601/c14739-40491967.html","cover":"./img/news/a-n_mu4vkf14m5dxga-cover.jpg","video":null,"gallery":[],"status":